    <briefdescription>
<para>Automatically unlocks and re-locks a unique_lock object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the reverse of a std::unique_lock object - instead of locking the mutex for the lifetime of this object, it unlocks it.</para>
<para>Make sure you don&apos;t try to unlock mutexes that aren&apos;t actually locked!</para>
<para>This is essentially a less-versatile boost::reverse_lock.</para>
<para>e.g. <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">std::mutex<sp/>mut;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">for</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(;;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::unique_lock<sp/>myScopedLock{mut};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>mut<sp/>is<sp/>now<sp/>locked</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>...<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">do</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>some<sp/>stuff<sp/>with<sp/>it<sp/><ref refid="namespacexrpl_1_1jss_1a777e5d66ef9703d23efa767aa32275b7" kindref="member">locked</ref><sp/>..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(xyz)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>...<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">do</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>some<sp/>stuff<sp/>with<sp/>it<sp/><ref refid="namespacexrpl_1_1jss_1a777e5d66ef9703d23efa767aa32275b7" kindref="member">locked</ref><sp/>..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>scope_unlock<sp/>unlocker{myScopedLock};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>mut<sp/>is<sp/>now<sp/>unlocked<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>remainder<sp/>of<sp/>this<sp/>block,</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>and<sp/>re-locked<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>end.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>...do<sp/>some<sp/>stuff<sp/>with<sp/>it<sp/>unlocked<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>mut<sp/>gets<sp/>locked<sp/>here.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>mut<sp/>gets<sp/>unlocked<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
